# Cython output. Every other .pyx in the tree has its generated .cpp covered
# by the subproject's own .gitignore; rednose is vendored without one.
rednose/helpers/ekf_sym_pyx.cpp

# The big model's .dlc is tracked -- the build needs it as an input and it is
# not reproducible from anything else in the tree. Its .thneed is not: scons
# recompiles it from the .dlc, and the result is specific to the GPU that
# recorded it, so a tracked copy would sit permanently modified on the device.
models/supercombo_big.thneed
